Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:28.42,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,小型蜘蛛怪 无名 属性值：弱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:35.56,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,升级 升级 升级 升级
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:55.56,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,俊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:56.54,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,俊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.60,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.08,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,俊
